  </li>
</ol>

<p>Multiply that by a few hundred—or a few thousand—students, and you’re staring at serious overhead.</p>

<p>Digital certificates, meanwhile, eliminate most of these expenses.
You’ll likely pay a licensing fee for a digital platform, but the long-term savings are significant. You’re cutting out paper, postage, and manual labor. Plus, fewer errors mean fewer reprints and re-issues.</p>

<p><em>Operational Benefit:</em> Digital delivery reduces the need to print and post individual certificates, especially for large or geographically distributed cohorts.</p>

